# Telegram channel adapter
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN: open Telegram, message @BotFather, run /newbot, follow
#   the prompts. BotFather replies with a token like "1234567890:AAH...". Paste
#   it here. Treat as a secret — anyone with the token can impersonate the bot.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=

# After deploy, register your webhook (one-time, replace <URL>):
#   curl -X POST "https://api.telegram.org/bot$TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN/setWebhook" \
#        -d "url=<URL>/channels/telegram"
